5. Verify the build and fix errors.
6. Publish a working preview.
7. Implement local storage and book importing.
8. Build the full reading experience.
9. Develop the Author Studio.
10. Add search, AI assistance, testing and release preparation.

## 9. Development rules
- Document every completed milestone.
- Record technical decisions and outstanding issues.
- Never describe an unimplemented feature as functional.
- Keep passwords, API keys and secrets out of this public repository.
- Update this log after every significant development step.

